@startuml
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK TC"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title qemuarm64-secureboot 開機與 TBBR 驗簽時序

participant "QEMU\n(virt,secure=on)" as QEMU #F5F7FA
participant "TF-A BL1\n(EL3 / ROM)" as BL1 #FCF3CF
participant "TF-A BL2\n(Trusted Boot)" as BL2 #F1948A
participant "TF-A BL31\n(EL3 Monitor)" as BL31 #FCF3CF
participant "OP-TEE OS\n(S-EL1 / BL32)" as OPTEE #F5B7B1
participant "U-Boot\n(NS-EL2 / BL33)" as UBOOT #85C1E9
participant "Linux + xtest\n(NS-EL1/0)" as LINUX #AED6F1

QEMU -> BL1 : 上電 Reset，執行 flash.bin @ 0x0
activate BL1
BL1 -> BL1 : 讀取 FIP 內 TB_FW_CERT\n以內嵌 ROTPK Hash + mbedTLS 驗簽
BL1 -> BL1 : 驗證 BL2 映像 Hash
BL1 -> BL2 : 驗簽通過，跳轉至 BL2
deactivate BL1
activate BL2

BL2 -> BL2 : 驗證 Trusted Key Cert\n(Root Key → Trusted World Key)
BL2 -> BL2 : 驗證並載入 BL31 (SOC_FW)
BL2 -> BL2 : 驗證並載入 BL32 (TOS_FW: OP-TEE)
BL2 -> BL2 : 驗證並載入 BL33 (NT_FW: U-Boot)
note right of BL2
  任一憑證或映像被竄改
  → mbedTLS 驗簽失敗
  → 直接 Panic 停機
end note

BL2 -> BL31 : 透過 SMC 交棒給 BL31 (EL3)
deactivate BL2
activate BL31

BL31 -> OPTEE : 初始化 SPD=opteed，進入 BL32
activate OPTEE
OPTEE -> OPTEE : 初始化安全記憶體與驅動\n載入 optee-ftpm Early TA
OPTEE --> BL31 : 初始化完成 (TEESMC_OPTEED_RETURN_ENTRY_DONE)
deactivate OPTEE

BL31 -> UBOOT : 切換至 Non-Secure EL2，跳轉 BL33
activate UBOOT
UBOOT -> LINUX : 從 wic.qcow2 載入並啟動 Linux Kernel
deactivate UBOOT
activate LINUX

LINUX -> BL31 : SMC 呼叫 (optee driver / xtest)
BL31 -> OPTEE : 路由至 Secure World 執行 TA
activate OPTEE
OPTEE --> BL31 : 回傳結果
deactivate OPTEE
BL31 --> LINUX : 返回 Normal World

@enduml
